    Given an input tensor, this function computes hyperbolic cosine of every
    element in the tensor. Input range is `[-inf, inf]` and output range
    is `[1, inf]`.

    ```python
    x = tf.constant([-float("inf"), -9, -0.5, 1, 1.2, 2, 10, float("inf")])
